    {
      "id": "recap1",
      "nav": {
        "tabs": [
          "1 TOOLS & STRUCTURES",
          "2 COLLECTIVE KNOWLEDGE"
        ],
        "active": 0
      },
      "image": {
        "variants": [
          {
            "source": "asset",
            "path": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/new-slides/recap1.png",
            "label": "reused-slide"
          }
        ],
        "active_index": 0
      },
      "vo": {
        "text": "It's built around two things: giving agents tools for complex creative and AI work, and access to the community's practical know-how.",
        "audio": {
          "asset": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/vo/recap1.mp3"
        }
      },
      "provenance": {
        "generator": {
          "tool": "edge-tts"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "recap2",
      "nav": {
        "tabs": [
          "1 TOOLS & STRUCTURES",
          "2 COLLECTIVE KNOWLEDGE"
        ],
        "active": 0
      },
      "image": {
        "variants": [
          {
            "source": "asset",
            "path": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/new-slides/recap2.png",
            "label": "reused-slide"
          }
        ],
        "active_index": 0
      },
      "vo": {
        "text": "First, the tools. Astrid gives agents a bunch of ways to generate images and video, understand and work with Comfy workflows, train models, and handle complex tasks like editing video timelines.",
        "audio": {
          "asset": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/vo/recap2.mp3"
        }
      },
      "provenance": {
        "generator": {
          "tool": "edge-tts"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "idea1_intro",
      "nav": {
        "tabs": [
          "1 TOOLS & STRUCTURES",
          "2 COLLECTIVE KNOWLEDGE"
        ],
        "active": 0
      },
      "image": {
        "variants": [
          {
            "source": "asset",
            "path": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/new-slides/idea1_intro.png",
            "label": "reused-slide"
          }
        ],
        "active_index": 0
      },
      "vo": {
        "text": "Behind the scenes, it keeps your project organized. It comes with a bunch of connected tools built in, but everything is a plugin, so you can swap things out or add your own.",
        "audio": {
          "asset": "../projects/astrid-intro/build/vo/idea1_intro.mp3"
        }
      },
      "provenance": {
        "generator": {
          "tool": "edge-tts"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "idea1_os",
